<Page title="Privacy Policy" eyebrow={`Last updated ${updated}`} description="How Strip and Street collects, uses and protects your information.">
  <p>This policy explains what information Strip and Street (“we”, “us”) collects when you visit stripandstreet.com and how it’s used.</p>
  <h2>Information you give us</h2>
  <p>If you sign up for our newsletter or use our contact form, we collect the details you submit, such as your name and email address. We use them only to reply to you or send the newsletter you asked for. Forms are processed by our hosting provider, Netlify, and newsletter subscriptions may be managed through Mailchimp. You can unsubscribe from any email at any time using the link in that email.</p>
  <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
  <p>Like most websites, our servers and service providers may log basic technical information such as your browser type, device, referring page, and approximate location derived from your IP address. We may use analytics tools, such as Google Analytics or Google Search Console, to understand how visitors use the site.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>We may show ads served by third parties, including Google. These vendors may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits to this site and other sites on the internet. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. When you click them, the retailer may set a cookie to track the referral. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We don’t sell your personal information. We share it only with the service providers described above, as needed to run the site, or when required by law.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to access, correct, or delete the information you’ve given us by reaching out through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under laws such as the GDPR or CCPA.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site isn’t directed at children under 13, and we don’t knowingly collect their information.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
</Page>
